OL,3,GNEWSAEighth teenager held over         
OL,4,AHalloween party stabbings              
OL,6,FAn eighth boy has been arrested on     
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after    
OL,8,Ffive teenagers were stabbed at a       
OL,9,FHalloween party.                       
OL,11,FHampshire Police said the 16-year-old  
OL,12,Ffrom Southampton was arrested on Monday
OL,13,Fmorning and remains in custody.        
OL,15,FFive boys, three aged 16 and two aged  
OL,16,F17, were injured when an uninvited     
OL,17,Fgroup allegedly got into a supervised  
OL,18,Fhouse party in Park Road, Chandler's   
OL,19,FFord, at about 22:30 GMT on 31 October.
OL,21,FAll five have since been discharged    
OL,22,Ffrom hospital.                         
